# ==========================================
# SaidLang Tutorial 02: Variables & Math
# ==========================================

# Different human ways to define variables:
set score to 100
let playerName be "Said"
make health = 100

# Arithmetic operations
increase score by 25
decrease health by 10

# Displaying variables
show "Player:"
show playerName
show "Score:"
show score
show "Health:"
show health
